      "translationRaw": "OnlytowandererscancomeEvernewtheshockofbeauty，Ofwhitecloudandredclouddawningfromthesea，Ofspringinthewild-plumandriver-willow。。。。Iwatchayelloworioledartinthewarmair，Andagreenwater-plantreflectedbythesun。SuddenlyanoldsongfillsMyheartwithhome，myeyeswithtears。",
